{"id":"657884","name":"咖喱牛仔骨","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/657884/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛仔骨","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛仔骨擦干水份备用。","img":"images/657884/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"胡萝卜土豆去皮切滚刀块。","img":"images/657884/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中热油放入牛仔骨。","img":"images/657884/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"煎至两面金黄后盛出。","img":"images/657884/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中底油放入土豆和胡萝卜翻炒。","img":"images/657884/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/657884/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入咖喱块，大火煮开搅拌均匀。","img":"images/657884/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入牛仔骨。","img":"images/657884/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"煮开盖上中小火焖。","img":"images/657884/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"焖至入味加入适量椰汁。","img":"images/657884/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"翻炒均匀大火收一下汁即可。","img":"images/657884/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657884/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657884/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657884/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}